1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:05,755
The same resonance that makes phenol acidic also makes its ring extremely reactive.

2
00:00:05,755 --> 00:00:16,145
The O H group feeds its lone pair into the ring, piling up electron density at the ortho and para positions, carbons two, four and six.

3
00:00:16,145 --> 00:00:20,221
Electrophiles attack there, far faster than with benzene.

